<title>USA: Banco Santander-Chile Q3 net income falls.</title>
<headline>Banco Santander-Chile Q3 net income falls.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-10-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p>	  Net   pesos     5,627,000     pesos  7,536,000</p>
<p>	  Nine months</p>
<p> Net		 31,969,000	     24,053,000</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: 1996 Q3 net includes one-time charges and gains for the merger with Banco Osorno. Excluding these gains and charges, 1996 third quarter net would have been 10.064 billion pesos.  </p>
<p>1996 nine-month figures excludes restructuring charges of 6.195 billion pesos and the one-time losses of 2.059 billion pesos.</p>
<p>Net interest revenue totaled 35.334 billion in the third quarter, compared to 34.606 billion in the year-ago quarter.</p>
</text>
